eting starts on a 15-minute grid, earliest first.\\n\\n    Work hours are 09:00-15:00, lunch (12:00-13:00) is unavailable,\\n    and each valid calendar event has a 15-minute cooldown afterward.\\n    Events are clipped to work hours; invalid or wholly outside events\\n    are ignored. The day value is accepted but not used.\\n\\n    meeting_duration must be a positive integer number of minutes.\\n    Invalid durations and schedules with no suitable slots return [].\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    if (\\n        not isinstance(meeting_duration, int)\\n        or isinstance(meeting_duration, bool)\\n        or meeting_duration <= 0\\n        or meeting_duration > WORK_END - WORK_START\\n    ):\\n        return []\\n\\n    busy_intervals: List[tuple[int, int]] = []\\n    for event in events:\\n        start = _to_minutes(event[\\\"start\\\"])\\n        end = _to_minutes(event[\\\"end\\\"])\\n        if end <= start or end <= WORK_START or start >= WORK_END:\\n            continue\\n\\n        clipped_start = max(start, WORK_START)\\n        clipped_end = min(end + SLOT_STEP, WORK_END)\\n        busy_intervals.append((clipped_start, clipped_end))\\n\\n    busy_intervals.append((LUNCH_START, LUNCH_END))\\n    busy_intervals = _merge_intervals(busy_intervals)\\n\\n    slots: List[str] = []\\n    for start in range(WORK_START, WORK_END - meeting_duration + 1, SLOT_STEP):\\n        end = start + meeting_duration\\n        overlaps = any(\\n            start < busy_end and end > busy_start\\n            for busy_start, busy_end in busy_intervals\\n        )\\n        if not overlaps:\\n            slots.append(_to_hhmm(start))\\n\\n    return slots\\n\",\"path\":\"src/solution.py\"}","call_id":"call_yUKY9E8Dphljv5r54EeOtGLE","id":"fc_0965bf216d02464d016aecefc8869087d2b72c7eda638521cb","name":"write_file","status":"completed","type":"function_call"}],"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","response_id":"resp_0965bf216d02464d016aecefb032dc87d2a3c2e0fe5c177372","status":"tool_calls","text":"I’ll apply the explicit 09:00–15:00 work-hours rule, ignore the day value, and retain lunch blocking and the existing 15-minute post-event buffer. I’ll also make invalid meeting durations return `[]`.\n","tool_calls":[{"arguments":{"content":"\"\"\"Suggest meeting start times within fixed working hours and around busy periods.\"\"\"\nfrom typing import List, Dict\n\nWORK_START = 9 * 60\nWORK_END = 15 * 60\nLUNCH_START = 12 * 60\nLUNCH_END = 13 * 60\nSLOT_STEP = 15\n\n\ndef _to_minutes(time_str: str) -> int:\n    hours, minutes = time_str.split(\":\")\n    return int(hours) * 60 + int(minutes)\n\n\ndef _to_hhmm(total_minutes: int) -> str:\n    return f\"{total_minutes // 60:02d}:{total_minutes % 60:02d}\"\n\n\ndef _merge_intervals(intervals: List[tuple[int, int]]) -> List[tuple[int, int]]:\n    if not intervals:\n        return []\n\n    intervals.sort()\n    merged: List[tuple[int, int]] = [intervals[0]]\n    for start, end in intervals[1:]:\n        last_start, last_end = merged[-1]\n        if start <= last_end:\n            merged[-1] = (last_start, max(last_end, end))\n        else:\n            merged.append((start, end))\n    return merged\n\n\ndef suggest_slots(\n    events: List[Dict[str, str]],\n    meeting_duration: int,\n    day: str\n) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return all feasible meeting starts on a 15-minute grid, earliest first.\n\n    Work hours are 09:00-15:00, lunch (12:00-13:00) is unavailable,\n    and each valid calendar event has a 15-minute cooldown afterward.\n    Events are clipped to work hours; invalid or wholly outside events\n    are ignored. The day value is accepted but not used.\n\n    meeting_duration must be a positive integer number of minutes.\n    Invalid durations and schedules with no suitable slots return [].\n    \"\"\"\n    if (\n        not isinstance(meeting_duration, int)\n        or isinstance(meeting_duration, bool)\n        or meeting_duration <= 0\n        or meeting_duration > WORK_END - WORK_START\n    ):\n        return []\n\n    busy_intervals: List[tuple[int, int]] = []\n    for event in events:\n        start = _to_minutes(event[\"start\"])\n        end = _to_minutes(event[\"end\"])\n        if end <= start or end <= WORK_START or start >= WORK_END:\n            continue\n\n        clipped_start = max(start, WORK_START)\n        clipped_end = min(end + SLOT_STEP, WORK_END)\n        busy_intervals.append((clipped_start, clipped_end))\n\n    busy_intervals.append((LUNCH_START, LUNCH_END))\n    busy_intervals = _merge_intervals(busy_intervals)\n\n    slots: List[str] = []\n    for start in range(WORK_START, WORK_END - meeting_duration + 1, SLOT_STEP):\n        end = start + meeting_duration\n        overlaps = any(\n            start < busy_end and end > busy_start\n            for busy_start, busy_end in busy_intervals\n        )\n        if not overlaps:\n            slots.append(_to_hhmm(start))\n\n    return slots\n","path":"src/solution.py"},"id":"call_yUKY9E8Dphljv5r54EeOtGLE","name":"write_file"}],"usage":{"cache_read_input_tokens":1310,"cache_write_input_tokens":956,"input_tokens":2269,"output_tokens":1751}}
